      "side": 1,
      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] ❌ **Changes Requested**\nBy returning `0` in the `default` case, this function silently masks any unmapped error codes (such as `RTS_ERROR_TIMEOUT` or `RTS_ERROR_INVALID_PARAMETER`) as success. \n\nConsequently, in `rts5817maa_init`, `ret` becomes `0`, and the initialization failure is completely ignored (the error bit isn`t set).\n\nPlease explicitly handle `RTS_FP_SUCCESS` and ensure all other unmapped errors return an appropriate error flag (like `FINGERPRINT_ERROR_INIT_FAIL`):\n```c\nstatic int convert_rts_snr_init_error_code(rts_fp_return_t code)\n{\n\tswitch (code) {\n\tcase RTS_FP_SUCCESS:\n\t\treturn 0;\n\tcase RTS_ERROR_NOT_SUPPORT_SENSOR:\n\t\treturn FINGERPRINT_ERROR_BAD_HWID;\n\tcase RTS_ERROR_IO_EXCEPTION:\n\t\treturn FINGERPRINT_ERROR_SPI_COMM;\n\tdefault:\n\t\treturn FINGERPRINT_ERROR_INIT_FAIL;\n\t}\n}\n```\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/cns/gg-d/home/tomhughes@google.com/review_trajectories/cl8417147_34ae535c-54bc-4657-9350-d48ff378bfbb.pb)",
